 "about": {
  "text": "We’ll be celebrating Christmas Eve together again this year at our traditional neighborhood event. With wool blankets, mulled wine, punch, and chili con/sin carne, we’ll be screening the enchanting animated film *Amélie and the Metaphysics of Pipes*—which was nominated for an Oscar this year—under the open-air sky. And indoors, we’ll be celebrating Dolly Parton with the ’80s comedy *9 TO 5*, in which she shines alongside Jane Fonda and Lily Tomlin.",
